 MESSAGE_DYSON_SHOT_TITLE: "星系暴行"
 MESSAGE_DYSON_SHOT_DESC: "我们遭到了星际大炮的攻击"
 MESSAGE_DYSON_TARGETED_TITLE: "Stellar Cannon Targeting"
 MESSAGE_DYSON_TARGETED_DESC: "A §RStellar Cannon§! is taking aim at §Y$SYSTEM$§!."
 dyson_gun_ship_button: "充能星际大炮"
 dyson_shot_action: "释放毁灭星辰之力"
 dyson_shot_activity_key: "正在充能"
 dyson_shot_progress_activity_key: "正在充能星际大炮（§Y$PROGRESS$%§!）"
 dyson_shot_required_progress_key: "£time£30§W天§!"
 tech_dyson_gun: "星际大炮"
 tech_dyson_gun_desc: "$dyson_gun_0_MEGASTRUCTURE_DETAILS$"
 allow_dyson_gun: "§H$UNLOCKS_MEGASTRUCTURE$：§!星际大炮"
 # Nomad Concepts
 REQUIRES_NOMADS_DLC: "[GetDatabankNomadsDlc]\n\n"
 REQUIRES_NOMADS_DLC_OWNED: "§t需要$DLC_NOMADS$DLC§!"
 REQUIRES_NOMADS_DLC_NOT_OWNED: "§M需要$DLC_NOMADS$DLC§!"
 MAY_REQUIRE_NOMADS_DLC: "[GetDatabankNomadsDlcNomadicEmpire]\n\n"
 # Singular: £nomad£ ['concept_nomadic_empire'] or £nomad£ §H$concept_nomadic_empire$§!
 # Plural: £nomad£ ['concept_nomadic_empires'] or £nomad£ §H$concept_nomadic_empires$§!
 concept_nomadic_empire: "游牧帝国"
 concept_nomadic_empires: "游牧帝国"
 concept_nomadic_empire_desc: "£nomad£ §H$concept_nomadic_empires$§!是一种运作在可移动的£arkship£ ['concept_arkships']之上，而非扎根于固定的£colony£ ['concept_colonies']的文明。他们无法宣称£system£ ['concept_systems']或者殖民£planet£ ['concept_planets']。\n\n§H游牧帝国§!能修建£waystation£ ['concept_waystations']来收集资源，也可以接受£planet£ ['concept_settled_empires']发来的£contract£ ['concept_contracts']。"
 # Singular: £district£ ['concept_district_ark_military'] or £district£ §H$concept_district_ark_military$§!
 # Plural: £district£ ['concept_district_ark_military_plural'] or £district£ §H$cconcept_district_ark_military_plural$§!
 concept_district_ark_military: "$district_ark_military$"
 concept_district_ark_military_plural: "$district_ark_military_plural$"
 concept_district_ark_military_desc: "—£housing£['concept_housing']：§G+200§!\n—£mod_job_technician_add£['concept_technicians']岗位：§G+200§!\n\n§L$district_generator_desc$§!"
 # Singular: ['concept_operational_reserves'] or §H$concept_operational_reserves$§!
 concept_operational_reserves: "运行储备"
 concept_operational_reserves_desc: "£nomad£ ['concept_nomadic_empires']的§H$concept_operational_reserves$§!是£minerals£ ['concept_minerals']与£energy£ ['concept_energy']的综合展现。\n\n§H$concept_minerals$§!和§H$concept_energy$§!仍有收入与支出，只是会以['concept_situation']的形式呈现。\n\n局势的各个§H阶段§!将对帝国£arkship£ ['concept_arkships']的许多方面产生影响，你也可以选择不同§H应对方案§!来节约资源或者燃烧资源以提高生产力。\n\n你可以从£market£ ['concept_market']中购买§H$concept_minerals$§!和§H$concept_energy$§!，但无法售卖。"
 operational_reserves_desc: "§t$concept_operational_reserves_desc$§!\n\n§G点击['concept_operational_reserves']打开数据库\n在菜单中点击£operational_reserves£ 打开['concept_situation_log_view']§!"
 # Singular: £planet£ ['concept_settled_empire'] or £planet£ §H$concept_settled_empire$§!
 # Plural: £planet£ ['concept_settled_empires'] or £planet£ §H$concept_settled_empires$§!
 concept_settled_empire: "定居帝国"
 concept_settled_empires: "定居帝国"
 concept_settled_empire_desc: "£planet£ §H$concept_settled_empires$§!是指以£planet£ ['concept_planets']上固定的£colony£['concept_colonies']为根基进行统治的文明，他们能够宣称£system£ ['concept_systems']并利用['concept_starbases']进行防御。\n\n对于£nomad£ ['concept_nomadic_empires']而言，§H定居帝国§!是潜在的£contract£ ['concept_contracts']与['concept_diplomatic_pacts']来源，不过当游牧舰队跨越定居帝国边境时也可能会引发外交摩擦。"
 # Singular: £contract£ ['concept_contract'] or £contract£ §H$concept_contract$§!
 # Plural: £contract£ ['concept_contracts'] or £contract£ §H$concept_contracts$§!
 concept_contract: "合约"
 concept_contracts: "合约"
 concept_contract_desc: "£contract£ §H$concept_contracts$§!既有由£planet£ ['concept_settled_empires']发布给£nomad£ ['concept_nomadic_empires']的任务，也有§H$concept_nomadic_empire$§!自身内部提出的任务。\n\n这些任务囊括了从突袭宿敌到运送外交官等一系列操作，通常只能由£arkship£ ['concept_arkships']来完成。\n\n§H合约§!在£interface£ ['concept_situation_log_view']中的$situation_log_view_tab_situation_log$选项卡中列出。"
 # Singular: £waystation£ ['concept_waystation'] or £waystation£ §H$concept_waystation$§!
 # Plural: £waystation£ ['concept_waystations'] or £waystation£ §H$concept_waystations$§!
 concept_waystation: "$waystation$"
 concept_waystations: "$waystation_plural$"
 concept_waystation_desc: "£waystation£ §H$concept_waystations$§!是一种空间站，由£nomad£ ['concept_nomadic_empires']所建造，能够从天体收集资源，并建立星际贸易航路，也被称为£wayline£ ['concept_waylines']。\n\n§H$concept_waystations$§!收集的资源被存储在§H驿站库存§!之中，等待着£construction_ship£ ['concept_logistic_ship']或者£arkship£ ['concept_arkship']前来提取。\n\n即使没有§H恒星系所有者§!的允许，也可以在£system£ ['concept_systems']中建造§H$concept_waystations$§!，不过这会给恒星系所有者的外交带来负面影响，给予他们§H$war_goal_wg_expel_nomads$§!战争目标。签署['concept_wayline_pact']则可以移除这些负面惩罚。$DOUBLE_NEW_LINE$帝国所能维持的§H$concept_waystations$§!数量由['concept_starbase_capacity']所限制。"
 # Singular: £wayline£ ['concept_wayline'] or £wayline£ §H$concept_wayline$§!
 # Plural: £wayline£ ['concept_waylines'] or £wayline£ §H$concept_waylines$§!
 concept_wayline: "驿道"
 concept_waylines: "驿道"
 concept_wayline_desc: "£wayline£ §H$concept_waylines$§!是由相邻£system£ ['concept_systems']中的£waystation£ ['concept_waystations']建立的星际贸易航线。\n\n§H驿站模块§!会提供沿§H$concept_wayline$§!传播的效果与修正，这些效果也会通过与§H恒星系所有者§!签订的['concept_wayline_pacts']进行共享。例如，§H$sm_waystation_logistics_hub$§!能够收集整条£waystation£ §H$concept_wayline$§!沿线的所有§H$concept_waystations$§!存储的资源。"
 # Singular: ['concept_wayline_pact'] or §H$concept_wayline_pact$§!
 # Plural: ['concept_wayline_pacts'] or §H$concept_wayline_pacts$§!
 concept_wayline_pact: "$wayline_pact$"
 concept_wayline_pacts: "$wayline_pact_plural$"
 concept_wayline_pact_desc: "§H$concept_wayline_pacts$§!是一种由£nomad£ ['concept_nomadic_empire']与另一个帝国所签订的['concept_diplomatic_pacts']。这些条约能让双方帝国从沿§H驿道§!传播的£wayline£ ['concept_wayline']§H修正§!中获益。\n\n此外，如果条约是在§H$concept_nomadic_empire$§!与£planet£ ['concept_settled_empire']之间签订的，那么§H驿道§!所产生的外交惩罚将消失。"
 # Singular: £construction_ship£ ['concept_logistic_ship'] or £construction_ship£ §H['concept_logistic_ships']§!
 # Plural: £construction_ship£ ['concept_logistic_ships'] or £construction_ship£ §H['concept_logistic_ships']§!
 concept_logistic_ship: "$nomads_constructor$"
 concept_logistic_ships: "$nomads_constructor_plural$"
 concept_logistic_ship_desc: "£construction_ship£§H$concept_logistic_ship$§!可以从天体中收获资源并运输到$arkship_cap_plural$。$tt_use$—从行星、卫星、小行星中['scripted_action:logistic_harvest_resources']$NEW_LINE$—在£system£['concept_systems']中建造['concept_waystations']以扩展£wayline£ ['concept_waylines']$NEW_LINE$—建造£waystation£ ['concept_megastructures']$NEW_LINE$—从£waystation£ §H$concept_waystations$§!中收集资源$NEW_LINE$—无法像其他§H方舟舰§!一样建造新的£arkship£ ['concept_arkships']$NEW_LINE$—研究特定['concept_special_projects']$tt_gain$—在£arkship£ ['concept_arkship']中建造§H$concept_logistic_ships$§!"
 # Singular: £arkship£ ['concept_arkship'] or £arkship£ §H$concept_arkship$§!
 # Plural: £arkship£ ['concept_arkships'] or £arkship£ §H$concept_arkships$§!
 concept_arkship: "$arkship_cap$"
 concept_arkships: "$arkship_cap_plural$"
 concept_arkship_desc: "£arkship£ §H$concept_arkships$§!是承载着£nomad£ ['concept_nomadic_empires']穿梭于虚空中的巨型飞船，同时发挥着£colony£ ['concept_colony']，['concept_starbase']与['concept_military_ship']的作用。$DOUBLE_NEW_LINE$-作为§H殖民地§!，飞船上有£district£ ['concept_districts']，£zone£ ['concept_district_specializations']，£building£ ['concept_buildings']以及£pop£ ['concept_pops']。$NEW_LINE$-作为§H恒星基地§!，飞船能作为['concept_shipyards']，并能够配备§H方舟模块§!与§H系统§!。$NEW_LINE$-§H$concept_arkships$§!的§H殖民地§!与§H恒星基地§!建造共享同一条队列。$NEW_LINE$-作为§H军用舰船§!，§H$concept_arkships$§!拥有多个机库和点防御，并配备厚重装甲与强力护盾。$NEW_LINE$-§H$concept_arkships$§!能够使用£construction_ship£ ['concept_logistic_ships']和£waystation£ ['concept_waystations']收集资源。$NEW_LINE$-§H$concept_arkships$§!也可以实现一些其他的战略行动，包括：$TABBED_NEW_LINE$-['concept_survey']$TABBED_NEW_LINE$-['concept_build_megastructure']$TABBED_NEW_LINE$-['scripted_action:arkship_harvest_resources']$TABBED_NEW_LINE$-§H方舟模块§!能够进一步解锁更多进阶行动。$NEW_LINE$-在研究£engineering_research£ §Y$tech_arkship_construction$§!之后可以在§H$concept_arkships$§!建造的['concept_megastructures']中修建新的§H$concept_arkships$§!。$NEW_LINE$-在研究£engineering_research£ §Y$tech_arkship_tier_2$§!和£engineering_research£ §Y$tech_arkship_tier_3$§!之后可以对§H$concept_arkships$§!进行升级。"
 # Verb (action): £settle£ ['concept_arkship_settle'] or £settle£ §H$concept_arkship_settle$§!
 # Verb (ongoing): £settle£ ['concept_arkship_settling'] or £settle£ §H$concept_arkship_settling$§!
 # Noun: £settle£ ['concept_arkship_settlement'] or £settle£ §H$concept_arkship_settlement$§!
 concept_arkship_settle: "定居"
 concept_arkship_settling: "定居"
 concept_arkship_settlement: "$arkship_settle$"
 concept_arkship_settle_desc: "£settle£ §H$concept_arkship_settle$§!是指让£arkship£ ['concept_arkship']永久停驻在一颗星球上，结束游牧航行的行为。\n\n需要完成['tradition_category:tradition_adaptability']或['tradition_category:tradition_versatility']传统树。\n\n要进行§H$concept_arkship_settle$§!，需要选择一艘§H方舟舰§!，右键点击一颗未殖民['concept_habitable_world']或在£interface£ ['concept_colony_view']点击§H殖民§!按钮。\n\n拥有更多§H方舟§!的帝国可以选择继续作为游牧帝国，并将新殖民的£planet£ ['concept_settled_empire']转变为一个['concept_subject']。\n\n所有位于未拥有恒星系中的['concept_waystations']都将转换为['concept_outposts']"
 # Verb (action): £embark£ ['concept_arkship_embark'] or £embark£ §H$concept_arkship_embark$§!
 # Verb (ongoing): £embark£ ['concept_arkship_embarking'] or £embark£ §H$concept_arkship_embarking$§!
 # Noun: £embark£ ['concept_arkship_embarkation'] or £embark£ §H$concept_arkship_embarkation$§!
 concept_arkship_embark: "登船"
 concept_arkship_embarking: "登船"
 concept_arkship_embarkation: "$decision_nomad_embarkation$"
 concept_arkship_embark_desc: "£embark£ §H$concept_arkship_embark$§!是指让£planet£ ['concept_settled_empire']离开['concept_habitable_world']，登上一艘£arkship£ ['concept_arkship']变为一个£nomad£ ['concept_nomadic_empire']的行为。\n\n这需要完成['tradition_category:tradition_adaptability']或['tradition_category:tradition_versatility']传统树。\n\n要进行§H登船§!，在一个£colony£ ['concept_colony']打开['concept_decisions']界面并选择§H$decision_nomad_embarkation$§!。\n\n如果帝国拥有复数['concept_colonies']，可以选择将余下部分转变为一个['concept_subject']，或是将新形成的§H游牧帝国§!释放为一个§H$concept_subject$§!。"
